ok   nanmax / nanmin on all-NaN slices return NaN for that slice and raise RuntimeWarning  (warnings: ['RuntimeWarning', 'RuntimeWarning'])
ok   nanmax / nanmin on integer arrays (no NaN possible) match max / min
ok   max of an empty array raises ValueError; initial= allows it
